  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Entire Late Jurassic animal based on MNHN.F.B13454, Eichstatt, Fig4A Charbonnier/Garassino2012. Conservative living restoration, not fossil slab or single appendage. {\"units\": \"meters\", \"carapace_length_estimated\": 0.035, \"body_length_estimated\": 0.085, \"first_leg_path_length_estimated\": 0.155, \"body_width_inferred\": 0.018, \"body_depth_estimated\": 0.02, \"uncertainty\": \"All size estimates from Fig4A own2cm bar, not published caliper measurements. CL approximately30-40mm; total body roughly75-95mm; P1 articulated path about140-170mm, pose not straight span. Width inferred because fossil is lateral/compressed.\"}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：Entire Late Jurassic animal based on MNHN.F.B13454, Eichstatt, Fig4A Charbonnier/Garassino2012. Conservative living restoration, not fossil slab or single appendage. {\"units\": \"meters\", \"carapace_length_estimated\": 0.035, \"body_length_estimated\": 0.085, \"first_leg_path_length_estimated\": 0.155, \"body_width_inferred\": 0.018, \"body_depth_estimated\": 0.02, \"uncertainty\": \"All size estimates from Fig4A own2cm bar, not published caliper measurements. CL approximately30-40mm; total body roughly75-95mm; P1 articulated path about140-170mm, pose not straight span. Width inferred because fossil is lateral/compressed.\"}"
